Steps in Postman
Open Postman.
Select GET.
Enter the URL, for example:
http://localhost:8080/actuator/health
Click Send.

You will receive a JSON response.

Example Response (/actuator/health)
{
    "status": "UP"
}
Example Response (/actuator/info)
{
    "app": {
        "name": "Spring Boot Actuator Demo",
        "version": "1.0",
        "description": "Demo Project for Spring Boot Actuator",
        "developer": "Subham"
    }
}
